<p>Hi {{ recipientName ?: 'there' }},</p>

{% if isAccount %}
    <p>Your Madori account <strong>{{ label }}</strong> is scheduled for deletion.</p>
{% else %}
    <p>The {{ noun }} <strong>{{ label }}</strong> is scheduled for deletion.</p>
{% endif %}

<p>
    Nothing has been deleted yet. Everything stays intact until
    <strong>{{ purgeAfter|date('F j, Y') }}</strong>, and you can undo this at
    any point before then:
</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{ restoreUrl }}">Restore {{ isAccount ? 'my account' : 'this ' ~ noun }}</a>
</p>

{% if isAccount %}
    <p>
        While the deletion is pending you won't be able to sign in — use the link
        above if you've changed your mind.
    </p>
{% else %}
    <p>
        In the meantime the {{ noun }} and everything in it is hidden from
        everyone who had access.
    </p>
{% endif %}

<p>
    After {{ purgeAfter|date('F j, Y') }} the {{ isAccount ? 'account' : noun }}
    and its contents are permanently deleted and this link stops working. That
    cannot be undone.
</p>

<p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">
    If you didn't request this, use the restore link right away and then change
    your password &mdash; someone else may have access to your account.
</p>

<p>&mdash; Madori</p>
